---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About XIQING AGRI"
	description="XIQING AGRI is an ongoing agricultural engineering practice that uses continuous experiments to test reliability, cost, energy use, yield and commercial value."
	locale="en"
	alternatePath="/about"
>
	<main>
		<header class="page-hero page-hero--about shell">
			<p class="eyebrow">ABOUT XIQING AGRI</p>
			<div class="page-hero__heading"><h1>About</h1><p>ENGINEERING AGRICULTURE<br />IN PUBLIC</p></div>
		</header>
		<section class="about-intro section--dark">
			<div class="shell about-intro__grid">
				<p class="eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</p>
				<div>
					<h2>XIQING AGRI is an ongoing automated-agriculture engineering practice based in Jimo, Qingdao.</h2>
					<p>Our goal is not to claim that one farming technology is “advanced,” but to answer practical questions through repeatable experiments.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="questions-title">
			<div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FIVE QUESTIONS</p><h2 id="questions-title">Every trial must answer</h2></div>
			<ol class="big-questions">
				<li><span>01</span>Can it run reliably?</li><li><span>02</span>What does it cost?</li><li><span>03</span>How much energy does it use?</li>
				<li><span>04</span>What can it actually produce?</li><li><span>05</span>How difficult is maintenance, and does it create commercial value?</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="about-statement">That is why we publish successful results—and failed ones.</p>
		</section>
		<section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="directions-title">
			<div class="shell">
				<div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH DIRECTIONS</p><h2 id="directions-title">Current research</h2></div>
				<ul class="direction-list">
					<li><span>01</span>Aeroponics</li><li><span>02</span>Natural-light use</li><li><span>03</span>Nutrient control</li>
					<li><span>04</span>Agricultural sensors</li><li><span>05</span>Automation</li><li><span>06</span>Modular growing systems</li><li><span>07</span>Low-cost engineering</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
